      "text": "The dragon conjures up a sudden mist in a 20-foot burst within 120 feet. All creatures within the mist become Concealed, and all creatures outside the mist become concealed to creatures within it. The dragon can use this action again to dismiss the mist—anyone else attempting to remove the dragonmist (via Gust of Wind or similar) must succeed at a counteract check. A young dragon can have up to three clouds of dragonmist active at a time."
